title: "IWAC Sentiment Analysis Visualization"
abstract: "Interactive SvelteKit application for visualizing sentiment analysis results on the Islam West Africa Collection (IWAC) corpus. Features comparative analysis between ChatGPT and Gemini models, multilingual support (French/English), and comprehensive filtering and export capabilities."
